---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Terms of Use" description="Terms of use for the site — what we do, what we don't, and the rules of using this site.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB')}</p>

    <p class="mt-6">
      By using {SITE.name} ({SITE.domain}) you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please leave the
      site. These terms are governed by the laws of Cyprus.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">1. What we are</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} is an independent sports analytics and information platform. We publish predictions,
      reviews and educational content for entertainment purposes only. We are NOT a bookmaker, we do not
      accept bets, and we do not hold funds on your behalf.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">2. Not financial advice</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing on this site is financial or investment advice. Our predictions are opinion based on public
      data and are provided as information. Any decision to place a bet with a bookmaker is entirely your
      own — the risk is yours alone.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">3. No guarantees</h2>
    <p>
      Betting carries risk. Past performance of our tips does not guarantee future results. Odds
      shown may change at the bookmaker before you place a bet. We do not guarantee wins, profit, or any
      specific outcome. You could lose all the money you stake.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">4. Eligibility</h2>
    <p>You may use this site only if:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
      <li>You are at least {SITE.minAge} years old.</li>
      <li>Gambling is legal in your country and region.</li>
      <li>You are not on any self-exclusion register (GAMSTOP, national scheme, etc.) for a bookmaker we link to.</li>
      <li>You have full legal capacity to enter agreements.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">5. Affiliate relationships</h2>
    <p>
      We earn revenue when a visitor clicks an affiliate link and signs up with a bookmaker. This does
      NOT cost you anything, and it never influences which picks we publish or which operators we review
      positively. Every review is written independently and every pick is generated by the same automated
      pipeline regardless of affiliate status.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">6. Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree NOT to:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
      <li>Scrape or systematically copy our content without permission.</li>
      <li>Republish our tips or results as if they were your own.</li>
      <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer our pipeline or infrastructure.</li>
      <li>Use the site to launder proceeds of crime or in any illegal way.</li>
      <li>Interfere with the site's operation, security, or other users.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3">Fair-use quotation for reviews or news commentary with attribution is welcomed.</p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">7. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      All content on {SITE.name} — text, code, design, statistics — is our property or licensed to us.
      Do not copy substantial parts without permission. The team names, league names and bookmaker names
      shown are the trademarks of their respective owners; we use them nominatively (to identify the
      thing) and this does not imply affiliation.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">8. Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      This site links to third-party websites (bookmakers, sports data providers, support organisations).
      We are not responsible for their content, terms, or availability. Follow them at your own risk.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">9. Availability</h2>
    <p>
      We try to keep the site online and the data fresh, but we do not guarantee uninterrupted access.
      Prices, odds and picks are indicative — always verify on the operator's site before betting. If a
      pick or result is materially wrong, tell us at <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> and we will correct it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">10. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} is not liable for any direct, indirect,
      incidental or consequential loss arising from the use of this site — including but not limited to
      betting losses, missed opportunities, data errors or downtime. This is a free information site;
      use of any content is at your own discretion and risk.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">11. Responsible gambling</h2>
    <p>
      We take responsible gambling seriously. If you are gambling more than you can afford, hiding it from
      loved ones, or feeling anxious about it — <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="/responsible-gambling">please seek help</a>. Every licensed operator we link to
      supports deposit limits, cool-off periods and self-exclusion. Use those tools.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">12. Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms. Material changes will be announced on the homepage or by email to
      newsletter subscribers. Your continued use of the site after a change means you accept the new
      terms. The "Last updated" date at the top always shows the current version.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">13. Contact & governing law</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms: <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Cyprus. Any dispute
      is subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Cyprus, without prejudice to your
      mandatory consumer-protection rights under EU law.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-slate-500">
      By continuing to use {SITE.name} you confirm you have read and accept these terms.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
